E2: roll: till -- 4 entries, from its first, in order, each signed by the key enrolled for it (fingerprint FP2); head H8, and no secret took part
E2: roll: till -- entry 3 of 4 existed no later than <time> (clockbox's word); the entry after it is ORDERED and UNDATED
